   "name": "config.py",
   "filePath": "config.py",
   "summary": "Single source of truth for MASTRA constants: data and forecast file paths, the speed-based severity scale, zone detection and message-passing settings, negotiation limits, safety-gate thresholds, and pinned LLM providers and model IDs.",
